('certificate_surface_shows_every_certificate_held',
 'The inventory surface shows every certificate we actually hold',
 'Metrc names a certificate file for 1,904 tags; coa_extract stamps 969, because one '
 'certificate covers many tags. 935 tags held a fetched and parsed certificate that '
